  "cn": "第 14 集 · 对阵表",
  "novel": "Barney created a 64-woman March Madness [[bracket|bracket]] to find who was [[sabotaging|sabotage]] his love life. \"Someone is [[ruining|ruin]] my [[reputation|reputation]],\" he [[declared|declare]].\n\nHe [[tracked|track]] down [[suspects|suspect]] and [[investigated|investigate]] each one. Some women [[laughed|laugh]]. Others [[slapped|slap]] him. The [[mystery|mystery]] deepened.\n\n\"This is [[karma|karma]],\" Robin [[observed|observe]]. \"You treated women badly, and now it's coming back.\"\n\nBarney [[refused|refuse]] to believe it. He [[narrowed|narrow]] the [[bracket|bracket]] to four women. Each had a reason to hate him.\n\nAt the final [[round|round]], Barney [[confronted|confront]] the winner. It was a woman he had [[forgotten|forget]] entirely. She had [[plotted|plot]] [[revenge|revenge]] for years.\n\n\"You don't even remember me,\" she said. Barney realized that [[karma|karma]] was real, and it had a memory longer than his.",
